    title: "Linux 7.2 核心更新：強化 AMD Zen 6、Intel Nova Lake 支援，提升多品牌筆電相容性",
    summary: "Linux 7.2 核心版本為 x86 平台整合了大量硬體驅動程式的更新，主要目標是提升對新一代處理器和多品牌筆記型電腦的支援度。AMD 方面新增了對 Zen 6 架構的支援，包括 HFI 驅動程式支援版本三的排名表，以及對 Model 80H SoC 的電源管理控制器 (PMC) 驅動程式支援。Intel 方面則加入了 Nova Lake 的支援。此外，各大製造商的硬體支援也大幅擴充，包括 ASUS 為 ROG Strix、Zephyrus 等型號新增支援；HP WMI 驅動程式支援 Omen 16-ap0xxx 等型號；Lenovo 增加了 CPU/GPU 可調參數和電池充電限制功能。這類更新對於確保 Linux 在新硬體上的穩定性和功能完整性至關重要，建議使用者關注核心版本更新以獲得最佳的硬體相容性。",
    tags: ["Linux 7.2", "AMD Zen 6", "Intel Nova Lake", "x86 驅動程式", "PMC 驅動程式", "硬體相容性"],
    title_en: "Linux 7.2 Kernel Update: Enhancing Support for AMD Zen 6 and Intel Nova Lake, Improving Multi-Brand Laptop Compatibility",
    summary_en: "The Linux 7.2 kernel version integrates numerous hardware driver updates for the x86 platform, primarily aiming to enhance support for next-generation processors and multi-brand laptops. AMD has added support for the Zen 6 architecture, including a ranking table for HFI driver support version three, and support for the Power Management Controller (PMC) driver for the Model 80H SoC. Intel has incorporated support for Nova Lake. Furthermore, hardware support for major manufacturers has been significantly expanded, including ASUS adding support for models like ROG Strix and Zephyrus; HP adding WMI driver support for models like Omen 16-ap0xxx; and Lenovo adding adjustable CPU/GPU parameters and battery charging limit functionality. These updates are crucial for ensuring stability and functional completeness of Linux on new hardware, and users are advised to monitor kernel version updates to achieve optimal hardware compatibility.",
    tags_en: ["Linux 7.2", "AMD Zen 6", "Intel Nova Lake", "x86 drivers", "PMC driver", "hardware compatibility"],
