    summary: "本文介紹一位開源開發者 Gianluca Masci 分享了一份關於 GNOME Shell 的概念驗證（PoC）代碼。目前 GNOME 在多顯示器環境下，背景圖通常會使用單一設定，無法實現每個螢幕獨立的背景。Masci 的 PoC 旨在引入必要的架構變更，讓 GNOME Shell 能夠支援每個顯示器擁有獨立的背景設定。此開發成果包含了一個用於處理多顯示器背景選擇的 GNOME Shell 設定工具。目前此代碼尚未提交給上游整合，但已透過 GitHub 儲存庫公開。這項開發進展展示了 GNOME 桌面環境在使用者介面客製化方面的潛力，並指出其創建過程部分使用了 AI 輔助技術。",
    tags: ["GNOME Shell", "Linux", "多顯示器", "背景圖", "PoC", "開源開發"],
    title_en: "GNOME Shell Experimental Feature: PoC Code Shared for Independent Multi-Display Background Settings",
    summary_en: "This article introduces a Proof-of-Concept (PoC) code shared by open-source developer Gianluca Masci concerning GNOME Shell. Currently, in a multi-display environment, GNOME typically uses a single background image setting, making it impossible to implement independent backgrounds for each screen. Masci's PoC aims to introduce necessary architectural changes, enabling GNOME Shell to support independent background settings for every display. This development includes a GNOME Shell settings tool designed to handle multi-display background selection. While this code has not yet been submitted for upstream integration, it has been made public via a GitHub repository. This development showcases the potential for customization within the GNOME desktop environment and notes that AI-assisted technology was partially used during its creation process.",
