    category: "Linux",
    title: "Coreboot 26.06 發布：支援 Intel Nova Lake、AMD Strix Halo 等新硬體平台，強化開機與恢復機制",
    summary: "Coreboot 軟體發布了最新季度版本 26.06，持續擴展其開源系統韌體支援範圍。本次更新重點涵蓋了多個前瞻性與現有硬體平台。在 Intel 方面，Coreboot 26.06 提供了初始的 Nova Lake SoC 支援，並針對現行 Panther Lake SoC 增加了 UFS 行內加密支援。此外，它也為舊版 Intel 平台帶來了開機效能提升和 Zstd 解壓縮等優化。在 AMD 方面，本次支援了 Ryzen AI Max 300 系列的 Strix Halo，並提升了整體支援度，新增了 ROM Armor 2，為 BIOS 載入失敗時提供了 A/B 恢復基礎設施。此外，Qualcomm 也加入了 Calypso SoC 的支援。本次版本同時增加了 31 個新的主機板支援，包括 ASUS、Framework 和 System76 等多品牌產品。這對於系統韌體開發者和硬體製造商至關重要，確保了新舊硬體都能獲得更穩定的開機和更高的安全性。",
    tags: ["Coreboot", "26.06", "Intel Nova Lake", "AMD Strix Halo", "系統韌體", "開機支援", "ROM Armor 2"],
    title_en: "Coreboot 26.06 Released: Supports New Hardware Platforms like Intel Nova Lake and AMD Strix Halo, Enhancing Boot and Recovery Mechanisms",
    summary_en: "Coreboot software has released its latest quarterly version, 26.06, continuing to expand its open-source system firmware support. This update focuses on multiple advanced and existing hardware platforms. On the Intel side, Coreboot 26.06 provides initial support for the Nova Lake SoC and adds UFS inline encryption support for the current Panther Lake SoC. Furthermore, it brings boot performance enhancements and Zstd decompression optimizations to older Intel platforms. On the AMD side, this update supports the Strix Halo of the Ryzen AI Max 300 series and improves overall support, adding ROM Armor 2, which provides A/B recovery infrastructure in case of BIOS loading failure. Additionally, Qualcomm has added support for the Calypso SoC. This version also includes support for 31 new motherboards, including products from multiple brands such as ASUS, Framework, and System76. This is crucial for system firmware developers and hardware manufacturers, ensuring that both new and old hardware receive more stable booting and higher security.",
    tags_en: ["Coreboot", "26.06", "Intel Nova Lake", "AMD Strix Halo", "System Firmware", "Boot Support", "ROM Armor 2"],
