    category: "Windows",
    title: "Windows 11 內測版更新：推出新的 WIP 體驗，並新增任務列尺寸自訂功能",
    summary: "微軟發布了新的 Windows 11 內測版建置，並宣布將逐步將新的 Windows Insider Program (WIP) 體驗推廣至零售版 Windows 11 用戶。這項更新讓標準零售版用戶也能在「設定」>「Windows Update」>「Windows Insider Program」中看到新的頻道體驗選項。新功能讓用戶可以更輕鬆地參與 Windows 開發，並在大多數情況下，無需完整重裝即可切換內測頻道或退出計畫。本次更新的 Beta 和 Experimental 版本分別為 Build 26220.8754 和 Build 26300.8758。此外，在 Experimental 頻道中，新增了「任務列尺寸」設定，讓用戶可以更精細地自訂任務列的尺寸，提升個人化體驗。微軟鼓勵用戶參與內測，以提供回饋，共同參與 Windows 的開發。",
    tags: ["Windows 11", "Windows Insider Program", "WIP", "Beta", "Experimental", "任務列"],
    title_en: "Windows 11 Insider Preview Update: Introduces new WIP experience and customizable taskbar size",
    summary_en: "Microsoft has released a new Windows 11 Insider Preview build and announced that it will gradually roll out the new Windows Insider Program (WIP) experience to retail Windows 11 users. This update allows standard retail users to see the new channel experience options under Settings > Windows Update > Windows Insider Program. The new feature enables users to participate in Windows development more easily, and in most cases, switch insider channels or exit the program without a full reinstallation. The Beta and Experimental builds for this update are Build 26220.8754 and Build 26300.8758, respectively. Furthermore, the Experimental channel introduces a 'Taskbar size' setting, allowing users to customize the taskbar size more precisely and enhance their personalized experience. Microsoft encourages users to participate in the insider program to provide feedback and contribute to Windows development.",
