    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple Xcode 26.6 更新：整合 Google Gemini，為開發者提供多樣化 AI 程式輔助工具",
    summary: "Apple 發布 Xcode 26.6 版本，大幅升級其整合開發環境（IDE）的程式輔助功能。本次更新最大的亮點是新增了對 Google Gemini 的支援，使其與現有的 Anthropic Claude Agent 和 OpenAI Codex 並列，為開發者提供更豐富的 AI 輔助選擇。此外，Xcode 26.6 也包含了 Swift 6.3.3，並支援 iOS、iPadOS、tvOS、watchOS、visionOS 和 macOS 的 26.5 版本 SDK。除了新增 AI 服務外，該版本還透過 Agent Client Protocol 支援其他相容的 AI Agent，並修復了多個 Bug 以提升穩定性。開發者可透過 App Store 下載此非 Beta 版本，這使得 Google Gemini 的功能從先前僅限於 Xcode 27 Beta 版本，擴展至更廣泛的用戶群。",
    tags: ["Apple", "Xcode", "Google Gemini", "AI 程式輔助", "Swift", "iOS 26.5"],
    title_en: "Apple Xcode 26.6 Update: Integrating Google Gemini to Offer Developers Diverse AI Coding Assistance Tools",
    summary_en: "Apple has released Xcode 26.6, significantly upgrading its integrated development environment (IDE) coding assistance features. The biggest highlight of this update is the addition of support for Google Gemini, placing it alongside existing Anthropic Claude Agent and OpenAI Codex, thereby offering developers a richer selection of AI assistance options. Furthermore, Xcode 26.6 includes Swift 6.3.3 and supports the 26.5 version SDK for iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, watchOS, visionOS, and macOS. In addition to the new AI services, the version also supports other compatible AI Agents through the Agent Client Protocol and fixes multiple bugs to improve stability. Developers can download this non-Beta version from the App Store, expanding the availability of Google Gemini's features from previously being limited to the Xcode 27 Beta version to a broader user base.",
