    title: "Amazon Q AI 輔助工具漏洞：惡意 Git 倉庫可執行程式碼並竊取雲端憑證",
    summary: "研究人員警告，許多 AI 程式碼輔助工具（如 Amazon Q）存在安全漏洞。這些工具在處理專案配置時，可能會執行來自 Git 倉庫的指令。攻擊者可利用此缺陷，將惡意程式碼「陷阱化」到 Git 儲存庫中，導致 AI 工具在執行專案配置時，無意間執行惡意指令。實務影響包括遠端執行程式碼（RCE）和竊取雲端憑證。開發者和資安人員應提高警覺，確保使用 AI 輔助工具時，對其執行權限進行嚴格的審核和限制，特別是當這些工具需要存取敏感的專案配置或雲端資源時。目前原文未公開提供具體的 CVE 編號或修補版本，但建議用戶應遵循 Amazon 或相關 AI 工具供應商的最新安全公告。",
    tags: ["Amazon Q", "Git 倉庫", "AI 輔助工具", "RCE", "雲端憑證", "資安漏洞"],
    title_en: "Amazon Q AI Assistant Tool Vulnerability: Malicious Git Repository Executes Code and Steals Cloud Credentials",
    summary_en: "Researchers warn that many AI coding assistant tools (such as Amazon Q) contain security vulnerabilities. When processing project configurations, these tools may execute commands originating from Git repositories. Attackers can exploit this flaw by 'trapping' malicious code into a Git repository, causing the AI tool to unintentionally execute malicious instructions while processing project configurations. Practical impacts include Remote Code Execution (RCE) and the theft of cloud credentials. Developers and security personnel should raise awareness and ensure that the execution permissions of AI assistant tools are strictly reviewed and limited, especially when these tools require access to sensitive project configurations or cloud resources. The original text does not currently provide specific CVE IDs or patched versions, but users are advised to follow the latest security announcements from Amazon or the relevant AI tool vendor.",
    tags_en: ["Amazon Q", "Git Repository", "AI Assistant Tool", "RCE", "Cloud Credentials", "Security Vulnerability"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/cyber-crime/2026/06/26/amazon-q-flaw-let-booby-trapped-git-repos-execute-code-swipe-cloud-creds/5263202", lang: "EN" }
    ]
