    title: "Oracle 承諾開放 MySQL 治理，但社群要求更明確的保障機制",
    summary: "本文討論了資料庫領域的治理趨勢，特別關注 Oracle 針對 MySQL 治理的承諾。雖然 Oracle 提出開放治理的意願，但社群和開發者群體對於其背後的機制和長期穩定性仍抱持懷疑態度。文章強調，資料庫的治理不應僅依賴單一商業巨頭，而是需要建立更透明、更具共識的開放標準。這對於依賴 MySQL 的企業和開發者來說，意味著必須持續關注資料庫生態系統的發展，並考慮建立多供應商、分散風險的架構，以避免被單一廠商的策略變動所影響。這是一個關於產業標準化和開源生態系統治理的重大議題，而非單一技術漏洞的修補。",
    tags: ["MySQL", "Oracle", "資料庫治理", "開源生態系統", "資料庫標準化"],
    title_en: "Oracle Commits to Open MySQL Governance, But Community Demands Clearer Safeguards",
    summary_en: "This article discusses governance trends in the database domain, focusing specifically on Oracle's commitment to MySQL governance. Although Oracle has expressed willingness to open governance, the community and developer groups remain skeptical about the underlying mechanisms and long-term stability. The article emphasizes that database governance should not rely solely on a single commercial giant, but rather requires the establishment of more transparent and consensus-driven open standards. For enterprises and developers relying on MySQL, this means continuously monitoring the development of the database ecosystem and considering the establishment of multi-vendor, risk-distributed architectures to avoid being impacted by a single vendor's strategic changes. This is a major issue concerning industry standardization and open-source ecosystem governance, rather than merely patching a single technical vulnerability.",
