    title: "個人開發者展示 RISC-V 平台上的多個系統級專案：從 FPGA 主機到 QNX 核心重寫",
    summary: "文章介紹了開發者 Yuri Zaporozhets 的多個低階系統設計專案，展示了其在 RISC-V 架構上的實力。他首先展示了基於 FPGA 的 GateMate 個人電腦，這台機器採用 25 MHz RISC-V 核心，並搭載了自研的 GMDOS 作業系統。接著，他開發了 System/359，這是一個受 IBM System/360 啟發的迷你主機，雖然非二進位兼容，但保留了其通道 I/O 模型等概念。最引人注目的是，他將 QNX 6.4 核心移植到 RISC-V 架構，並進行了重寫，開發出名為 QRV 的作業系統。QRV 是一個從頭重構的 64 位元 LP64 系統，而非原始 QNX 原始碼的修補。這些專案展示了開發者在低階系統設計、FPGA 實作、以及跨代作業系統移植方面的深厚技術能力，特別是針對 RISC-V 平台的應用。",
    tags: ["RISC-V", "QNX", "FPGA", "低階系統", "嵌入式系統", "作業系統", "System/360"],
    title_en: "Individual Developer Showcases Multiple System-Level Projects on RISC-V Platform: From FPGA Host to QNX Core Rewrite",
    summary_en: "The article introduces developer Yuri Zaporozhets' multiple low-level system design projects, showcasing his expertise in the RISC-V architecture. He first presented the GateMate personal computer, which is based on FPGA and utilizes a 25 MHz RISC-V core, running a self-developed GMDOS operating system. Next, he developed System/359, a mini-computer inspired by the IBM System/360. Although not binary compatible, it retains concepts such as its channel I/O model. Most notable is his porting and rewriting of the QNX 6.4 core to the RISC-V architecture, resulting in an operating system named QRV. QRV is a 64-bit LP64 system that was completely refactored, rather than a patch of the original QNX source code. These projects demonstrate the developer's deep technical capabilities in low-level system design, FPGA implementation, and cross-generation operating system porting, especially for the RISC-V platform.",
    tags_en: ["RISC-V", "QNX", "FPGA", "Low-Level System", "Embedded System", "Operating System", "System/360"],
